# "Whenever another creature you control enters, it gets +2/+0 and gains haste until end of turn." Bot1 casts Enduring Courage on turn 1: it is a 3/3 and
# is not "another creature", so its own entering pumps nothing. Bot2's Ornithopter on turn 2 enters under the opponent's control and stays a 0/2 with no
# haste (the control). On turn 3 Bot1's Ornithopter enters, becomes a 2/2 with haste and attacks the turn it was cast for 2; at the end of the turn the
# pump and the haste are gone (CR 611.2, 514.2): on Bot2's turn 4 it is a 0/2 again.

